From: appkins <nbatkins@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] DwUsbHostDxe: stop truncating register addresses in Wait4Bit

Wait4Bit() took its register address as a UINT32:

  Wait4Bit (
    IN  EFI_EVENT Timeout,
    IN  UINT32    Reg,
    ...

Every caller passes DwHc->DwUsbBase + offset, and DwUsbBase is an
EFI_PHYSICAL_ADDRESS. On BCM2711 and earlier that is 0xFE980000 and the
conversion is lossless, so the bug never showed. On BCM2712 the core sits
at 0x10_0048_0000: GRSTCTL is 0x1000480010, and passing it through a
UINT32 leaves 0x00480010.

PcdSystemMemoryBase is 0x00400000, so that address is not unmapped and it
does not fault -- it is ordinary DRAM. Every Wait4Bit() poll on this
platform has been reading and re-reading a word of system memory instead
of a register:

  - waiting for GRSTCTL.CSFTRST to clear "succeeded" immediately, because
    bit 0 of that DRAM word happened to be clear;
  - waiting for GRSTCTL.AHBIDLE to set never succeeded, because bit 31 of
    it never became set;

which presented as a core that reset but would not go idle. It was not
the core. Instrumented, the same register the wait had given up on read
back correctly at the moment of the timeout:

  DwCoreReset: AHBIDLE Timeout! GRSTCTL 80000000 GINTSTS 5400882B ...

GRSTCTL is 0x80000000 there -- AHBIDLE set -- because that DEBUG reads
MmioRead32 (DwHc->DwUsbBase + GRSTCTL) directly, with no truncating
parameter in the way. All 78 other register accesses in this driver pass
the 64-bit expression straight to MmioRead32/MmioWrite32 and were always
correct; Wait4Bit was the one place an address crossed a UINT32.

The reset was only the first casualty. Wait4Bit also backs the TX and RX
FIFO flushes, the per-channel halt in DwHcInit(), and Wait4Chhltd() on
every transfer, so nothing that polls a bit could have worked on this
platform.

Take the address as UINTN, which is what MmioRead32() takes.

Upstream-Status: Submittable [with an RPi5 platform port]
Signed-off-by: appkins <nbatkins@gmail.com>
---
diff -urN a/Platform/RaspberryPi/Drivers/DwUsbHostDxe/DwUsbHostDxe.c b/Platform/RaspberryPi/Drivers/DwUsbHostDxe/DwUsbHostDxe.c
--- a/Platform/RaspberryPi/Drivers/DwUsbHostDxe/DwUsbHostDxe.c
+++ b/Platform/RaspberryPi/Drivers/DwUsbHostDxe/DwUsbHostDxe.c
@@ -81,7 +81,7 @@
 EFI_STATUS
 Wait4Bit (
   IN  EFI_EVENT Timeout,
-  IN  UINT32    Reg,
+  IN  UINTN     Reg,
   IN  UINT32    Mask,
   IN  BOOLEAN   Set
   )
